# Phase 3: Calendar Integrations, Modularity, and Refinement

This phase focuses on finalizing the Google and Apple Calendar integrations, refactoring the brief generator for better maintainability, and optimizing the frontend user experience.

## Proposed Changes

### 1. Calendar Integration Finalization
The user has added the initial routing and service placeholders. We need to ensure these are robust, handle deduplication, and are integrated into the background sync cycle.

#### [MODIFY] [backend/services/calendar_sync.py](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/calendar_sync.py)
- Implement deduplication logic using event UIDs (Google ID for GCal, iCalUID for iCloud).
- Ensure events are correctly updated if they already exist rather than always adding new ones.
- Add support for different calendar colors/categories.

#### [MODIFY] [backend/jobs/scheduler.py](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/jobs/scheduler.py)
- Integrate [sync_google_calendar](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/calendar_sync.py#37-110) and [sync_apple_calendar](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/calendar_sync.py#111-171) into the [canvas_sync_job](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/jobs/scheduler.py#47-75) or create a new `calendar_sync_job` to run periodically (e.g., every 30 minutes).

### 2. Brief Generator Refactoring
The [brief_generator.py](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/brief_generator.py) is currently a large file with mixed responsibilities. We will improve its modularity.

#### [MODIFY] [backend/services/brief_generator.py](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/brief_generator.py)
- Extract data gathering logic (context fetching) from the formatting and AI prompt engineering logic.
- Implement a template-based approach for the final brief output to allow for easier customization.

### 3. Frontend Refinement
Improve the UX of the new features and address monolithic components.

#### [MODIFY] [frontend/app/settings/page.tsx](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/frontend/app/settings/page.tsx)
- Add UI sections for connecting Google and Apple calendars, including status indicators and manual sync buttons.

#### [MODIFY] [frontend/components/dashboard/DashboardAgenda.tsx](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/frontend/components/dashboard/DashboardAgenda.tsx)
- Ensure calendar events from external providers are visually distinguished from local classes or tasks.

